        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Add Reverb to a Voice\n\nPlaces a dry vocal in a simulated room. The workflow keeps the original signal alongside the reverb so the voice stays clear instead of washing out.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Audio\" takes the dry recording. \"2 Reverb\" applies a room scale of 0.7, damping of 0.4, a wet level of 0.25 and a dry level of 0.6. \"3 Result\" plays the processed audio.\n\n**Try this:** Raise room_scale to 0.9 and wet_level to 0.4 on \"2 Reverb\" for a hall sound, or lower both for a small booth."
        },
